Welcome to Screenote
====================

Your account is ready. Here's how to get started.

Screenote is a visual feedback tool for AI agents. Publish captures with the Screenote CLI, annotate them, and let your agent retrieve precise feedback.

Getting started:

1. Create a project — group your screenshots by project, feature, or sprint.
2. Install the Screenote CLI — go install github.com/ivankuznetsov/screenote-cli/cmd/screenote@latest
3. Publish screenshots — upload agent-produced PNG/JPEG files or a complete snapshot manifest.
4. Annotate and iterate — mark what is wrong, then let your agent retrieve annotations and cropped images through the CLI.

